      "explanation": "(a) (Acenaphthene)<br><br>\n<img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1kwlzz51y/6dc15c03-65af-42c5-be3f-f1cd9f35a3eb/e6d30f60-51cd-11ec-9844-f70c287671ef/file-1kwlzz51z.jpeg?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1kwlzz51y/6dc15c03-65af-42c5-be3f-f1cd9f35a3eb/e6d30f60-51cd-11ec-9844-f70c287671ef/file-1kwlzz51z.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Main 2021 (Online) 1st September Evening Shift Chemistry - Basics of Organic Chemistry Question 173 English Explanation 1\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1kwlzz51y/6dc15c03-65af-42c5-be3f-f1cd9f35a3eb/e6d30f60-51cd-11ec-9844-f70c287671ef/file-1kwlzz51z.jpeg?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1kwlzz51y/6dc15c03-65af-42c5-be3f-f1cd9f35a3eb/e6d30f60-51cd-11ec-9844-f70c287671ef/file-1kwlzz51z.jpeg?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1kwlzz51y/6dc15c03-65af-42c5-be3f-f1cd9f35a3eb/e6d30f60-51cd-11ec-9844-f70c287671ef/file-1kwlzz51z.jpeg?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1kwlzz51y/6dc15c03-65af-42c5-be3f-f1cd9f35a3eb/e6d30f60-51cd-11ec-9844-f70c287671ef/file-1kwlzz51z.jpeg?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1kwlzz51y/6dc15c03-65af-42c5-be3f-f1cd9f35a3eb/e6d30f60-51cd-11ec-9844-f70c287671ef/file-1kwlzz51z.jpeg?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1kwlzz51y/6dc15c03-65af-42c5-be3f-f1cd9f35a3eb/e6d30f60-51cd-11ec-9844-f70c287671ef/file-1kwlzz51z.jpeg?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\">\n<br><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.181ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -511 1000 522\" xmlns:xlink=\"